  message: "Closed by Phase 3 PR4 (commit 020615f524). Added ClaimVerdict.inconclusive value + refactored verify_claims.py to return 'inconclusive' for missing-data / malformed-input cases instead of falling through to 'confirmed'. CLI exit-code mapping: confirmed→0, not_confirmed→1, inconclusive→2. The verdict_enum validator class enforces this at runtime; self-analysis at 0 violations."  # 668b
